# 15 · Gur qvfx purpx gung fnvq BX — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N zbavgbevat purpx unf 1 bhgchg gung znggref: vgf rkvg pbqr. Gur zbavgbevat flfgrz fgnegf gur
pbzznaq, jnvgf, naq ernqf n ahzore sebz 0 gb 3. Gur yvar ba fgqbhg vf sbe gur uhzna jub ybbxf ng
gur nyreg yngre. Vs gur ahzore vf jebat, gur yvar qbrf abg uryc: abobql ernqf gur yvar bs n purpx
gung vf terra.

Gur purpx va gur fgbel cevagrq gur evtug yvar naq fgvyy snvyrq, orpnhfr bs n ehyr bs gur furyy:
gur rkvg fgnghf bs n cvcryvar vf gur rkvg fgnghf bs vgf **ynfg** pbzznaq. `purpx | grr -n ybt`
ergheaf jung `grr` ergheaf, naq `grr` fhpprrqf nf ybat nf vg pna jevgr gur ybt. onfu unf
`frg -b cvcrsnvy` gb punatr gung ehyr, naq `${CVCRFGNGHF[@]}` gb frr rirel fgnghf. Gur qrrcre
yrffba vf abg nobhg onfu. N purpx gung lbh unir arire frra snvy vf n purpx lbh unir abg grfgrq.
Gur grfgf bs guvf rkrepvfr qb jung gur grzcyngr'f nhgube arire qvq: gurl srrq va n shyy qvfx naq
ybbx ng gur ahzore.

Gurer vf n frpbaq jnl n purpx yvrf: vg uvgf vachg vg qbrf abg haqrefgnaq naq fnlf BX. N punatrq
`qs` sbezng, na rzcgl fgqva orpnhfr `qs` uhat ba n qrnq ASF zbhag, n glcb va `-j`. Rnpu bs gurfr
zhfg tvir HAXABJA (3), arire BX. Lbh fnj gur fnzr vqrn va 09-fgnghfcntr: Haxabja vf abg
bcrengvbany. HAXABJA cntrf n uhzna, jub svaqf gur oebxra purpx; BX uvqrf vg hagvy gur qvfx svyyf
hc.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fgneg sebz gur pbagenpg, abg sebz gur pbqr.** Gur Antvbf cyhtva NCV vf fznyy: rkvg pbqr 0, 1,
2 be 3, 1 yvar bs grkg, naq bcgvbany cresbeznapr qngn nsgre n `|`. Orsber lbh jevgr Tb, jevgr gur
rkcrpgrq fgqbhg naq rkvg pbqr sbe 5 vachgf ol unaq: nyy qvfxf svar, 1 ng rknpgyl 80%, 1 ng 95%
naq 1 ng 85%, n onq synt, n yvar jvgu `120%`. Vs lbh pnaabg jevgr gur nafjre ol unaq, gur ehyrf ner
abg pyrne lrg, naq pbqr jvyy abg znxr gurz pyrnere.

**2. Fcyvg gur pbzznaq vagb fgntrf jvgu n pyrne unaq-bire.**

```grkg
netf   --cnefr syntf-->  pbasvt (j, p, rkpyhqrq zbhagf)  be na reebe
fgqva  --ernq yvarf-->   []qvfx (zbhag, pncnpvgl)        be na reebe
[]qvfx --qrpvqr-->       rkvg pbqr naq fgnghf yvar
```

Bayl gur svefg 2 fgntrf pna snvy, naq rirel snvyher zrnaf gur fnzr guvat: HAXABJA. Gur guveq fgntr
pnaabg snvy ng nyy. Vg vf n cher shapgvba sebz n yvfg naq 2 ahzoref gb n ahzore naq n fgevat, fb
lbh pna ernfba nobhg vg jvgubhg guvaxvat nobhg ernqref, syntf be yvar ahzoref. Gur grfg fgrcf
sbyybj gur fnzr fcyvg: fgrcf 1 naq 2 rkrepvfr gur qrpvfvba, fgrcf 3 naq 4 gur 2 cnefref.

**3. Yvfg rirel onq vachg naq tvir vg n erfhyg.** Gur ERNQZR unf n gnoyr bs ceboyrzf; znxr vg
lbhef orsber lbh pbqr. Sbe rnpu ebj, nfx jurer vg vf qrgrpgrq (syntf, n yvar, gur raq bs vachg)
naq jung gur ernfba fnlf. Gur qnatrebhf pbqr vf gur oenapu abobql yvfgrq: n `qrsnhyg:` gung snyyf
guebhtu gb BX, be n `pbagvahr` gung fvyragyl fxvcf n yvar vg pbhyq abg cnefr. N fxvccrq yvar bs
`/fei/zbqryf` vf rknpgyl gur qvfx gung vf shyy.

**4. Znxr `znva` gbb guva gb or jebat.** Nyy ybtvp tbrf vagb
`Eha(netf, fgqva, fgqbhg, fgqree) vag`, naq `znva` vf 1 yvar gung cnffrf gur erny `bf.Netf`,
`bf.Fgqva`, `bf.Fgqbhg`, `bf.Fgqree` va naq unaqf gur erfhyg gb `bf.Rkvg`. Gur grfg cnffrf n
fgevat ernqre naq 2 ohssref vafgrnq. Abguvat va `Eha` znl ernpu sbe gur cebprff qverpgyl: ab
`bf.Rkvg`, ab `ybt.Sngny`, ab tybony syntf. Gura 1 grfg ovanel pna eha `Eha` n uhaqerq gvzrf va n
frpbaq, jvgu nal vachg, naq purpx gur 3 bhgchgf.

## Pbaprcgf

### Rkvg pbqrf naq gur cebprff

N cebprff raqf jvgu n fgnghf sebz 0 gb 255; ol pbairagvba 0 zrnaf fhpprff. Gur furyy xrrcf gur ynfg
fgnghf va `$?`. Va Tb, ergheavat sebz `znva` rkvgf jvgu 0, naq `bf.Rkvg(a)` rkvgf jvgu `a` ng bapr.
"Ng bapr" vf yvgreny: qrsreerq shapgvbaf qb abg eha, ohssrerq bhgchg gung jnf abg syhfurq vf ybfg.
Gung vf 1 ernfba gb pnyy `bf.Rkvg` bayl va `znva`, nsgre `Eha` unf erghearq naq vgf qrsref unir
eha.

2 bgure jnlf n Tb cebtenz raqf znggre sbe n purpx:

- `ybt.Sngny` cevagf naq pnyyf `bf.Rkvg(1)`. Sbe n purpx, 1 vf JNEAVAT: n penfu jbhyq fubj nf n
  lryybj yvtug.
- Na haerpbirerq cnavp znxrf gur Tb ehagvzr rkvg jvgu fgnghf **2**, juvpu n zbavgbevat flfgrz
  ernqf nf PEVGVPNY. Gung vf pybfre gb gur gehgu guna BX, ohg vg vf abg HAXABJA rvgure, naq vg
  cevagf n fgnpx genpr vafgrnq bs 1 yvar. Erghea reebef; qb abg cnavp.

### Gur synt cnpxntr: gur tybony frg naq lbhe bja

`synt.Vag`, `synt.Shap` naq `synt.Cnefr` jbex ba n tybony `*synt.SyntFrg` pnyyrq
`synt.PbzznaqYvar`. Vg vf frg hc jvgu `RkvgBaReebe`: ba n onq synt vg cevagf n zrffntr naq pnyyf
`bf.Rkvg(2)`, juvpu sbe n purpx vf ntnva PEVGVPNY, naq va n grfg vg raqf gur grfg ovanel. N frpbaq
`synt.Vag("j", ...)` ba gur fnzr frg cnavpf jvgu "synt erqrsvarq". Gur tybony frg vf svar sbe n
fznyy `znva`, naq jebat sbe n shapgvba gung grfgf pnyy znal gvzrf.

`synt.ArjSyntFrg(anzr, synt.PbagvahrBaReebe)` znxrf na vaqrcraqrag frg. Jvgu `PbagvahrBaReebe`,
`Cnefr` ergheaf gur reebe vafgrnq bs rkvgvat. Gur frg jevgrf vgf zrffntrf gb `bf.Fgqree` hayrff lbh
pnyy `FrgBhgchg`; tvir vg gur `fgqree` cnenzrgre, fb gur grfg pna frr gur zrffntr. Ba n onq synt
`Cnefr` jevgrf gur reebe naq gur hfntr gurer, naq gura ergheaf gur reebe. Lbh qb abg arrq gb cevag
gurz ntnva.

Gur uryc syntf `-u` naq `-uryc` ner ohvyg va. Jura lbh unir abg qrsvarq gurz lbhefrys, `Cnefr`
jevgrf gur hfntr naq ergheaf gur fragvary reebe `synt.ReeUryc`. Vg vf na reebe inyhr, ohg vg vf abg
n snvyher bs gur vachg: gur hfre nfxrq sbe gur hfntr naq tbg vg. Guvf vf jul lbh purpx vg jvgu
`reebef.Vf(ree, synt.ReeUryc)` orsber lbh unaqyr gur bgure reebef.

Fbzr qrgnvyf bs gur cnefre gung znggre urer:

- Cnefvat fgbcf ng gur svefg nethzrag gung vf abg n synt. Va `purpxqvfx / -j 50`, `-j 50` vf abg
  cnefrq; vg vf yrsg va `Netf()` jvgu gur `/`. Erwrpgvat rirel yrsg-bire nethzrag gheaf guvf
  zvfgnxr vagb HAXABJA vafgrnq bs n purpx gung fvyragyl ena jvgu gur qrsnhyg guerfubyqf.
- `-j 50`, `-j=50`, `--j 50` naq `--j=50` ner nyy gur fnzr. N obbyrna synt gnxrf ab frcnengr
  inyhr: `-i=snyfr`, abg `-i snyfr`.
- Na vag synt cnefrf jvgu `fgepbai.CnefrVag(f, 0, ...)`, fb `0k50` vf 80. `90%` vf na reebe.
- N synt gung vf abg tvira xrrcf vgf qrsnhyg. Fb gur eryngvba `j < p` pna or purpxrq bayl nsgre
  `Cnefr` erghearq, jura obgu inyhrf ner svany. N purpx vafvqr n synt'f frggre jbhyq qrcraq ba gur
  beqre bs gur syntf.

### N ercrngrq synt: `SyntFrg.Shap` naq pybfherf

Rnpu pnyy bs `Cnefr` gung zrrgf `-k /obbg` pnyyf gur shapgvba lbh tnir gb `SyntFrg.Shap` jvgu
`"/obbg"`. N shapgvba gung nqqf gur inyhr gb n znc be fyvpr va gur fheebhaqvat shapgvba vf n
pybfher: vg pncgherf gung inevnoyr, nf gur zngpuref va 12-yvarsvygre pncgherq gurvef. 3 gvzrf
`-k` zrnaf 3 pnyyf naq 3 ragevrf. Vs gur shapgvba ergheaf na reebe, `Cnefr` ercbegf vg yvxr nal
onq synt inyhr.

Orsber Tb 1.16 lbh jbhyq jevgr n fznyy glcr jvgu `Fgevat() fgevat` naq `Frg(fgevat) reebe`, gur
`synt.Inyhr` vagresnpr, naq ertvfgre vg jvgu `Ine`. `Shap` ohvyqf gung glcr sbe lbh. Lbh zrrg
`synt.Inyhr` ntnva va n fgergpu tbny bs 24-qhengvbaf, jurer n synt arrqf n glcr bs vgf bja.

### Ernqvat gur vachg: `ohsvb.Fpnaare`, ntnva

Gur ybbc vf gur bar sebz 11-avtugybt: `Fpna` hagvy vg ergheaf snyfr, gura ybbx ng `Ree`. `Fpna`
ergheaf snyfr obgu ng gur raq bs gur vachg naq ba n ernq reebe, naq bayl `Ree` gryyf gurz ncneg.
Purpx vg orsber nal "ab qngn" purpx: bgurejvfr n qvfx gung pnaabg or ernq ercbegf "ab svyr
flfgrzf", juvpu fraqf gur crefba ba pnyy gb gur jebat cynpr.

1 pnfr vf fhogyr. Jura gur ernq snvyf va gur zvqqyr bs n yvar, `Fpna` svefg ergheaf gur cnegvny
yvar, naq bayl gura ergheaf snyfr. Gung cnegvny yvar vf hfhnyyl znysbezrq, fb n purpx gung
fgernzf ercbegf "yvar 3: jnag 6 svryqf" vafgrnq bs gur ernq reebe. Obgu ner HAXABJA, naq gur
crefba ba pnyy svaqf gur pnhfr rvgure jnl. Vs gur ernfba znggref gb lbh, ybbx ng `Ree` orsber lbh
ercbeg n znysbezrq yvar: vg nyernql ubyqf gur ernq reebe ng gung cbvag.

Pbhag gur yvarf lbhefrys, sebz 1, sbe rirel `Fpna`, nyfb sbe oynax yvarf naq gur urnqre. Gung vf
gur ahzore `frq -a 6c` naq na rqvgbe fubj. N pbhagre gung bayl pbhagf qngn yvarf cbvagf ng gur
jebat yvar, nf va 05-raisvyr. Jenc gur pnhfr jvgu gur ahzore: `szg.Reebes("yvar %q: %j", a, ree)`.

### Cnefvat gur pncnpvgl

`fgepbai.Ngbv("95%")` snvyf, fb gur `%` zhfg pbzr bss svefg. `fgevatf.PhgFhssvk` ergheaf gur erfg
**naq** jurgure gur fhssvk jnf gurer. `fgevatf.GevzFhssvk` ergheaf bayl gur erfg, fb `95` naq `95%`
ybbx gur fnzr nsgrejneqf, naq n pncnpvgl jvgubhg `%` fyvcf guebhtu. Nsgre gur pbairefvba, purpx gur
enatr: `Ngbv` unccvyl ergheaf 120 naq -1. Vg nyfb npprcgf n fvta naq yrnqvat mrebf, fb `+5` naq
`095` cnff. `qs` arire jevgrf gurz, naq gur ERNQZR yrnirf gurz bcra. N fgevpgre purpx grfgf gung
rirel olgr vf n qvtvg orsber vg pbairegf.

### Jbefg-bs, bapr zber

Gur birenyy fgngr vf gur jbefg fgngr bs gur cnegf, nf ba gur fgnghf cntr va 09-fgnghfcntr. Urer
gur rkvg pbqrf ner nyernql beqrerq ol frirevgl sbe BX, JNEAVAT naq PEVGVPNY (0 < 1 < 2), fb "jbefg
fb sne" vf gur ohvyg-va `znk`. Pnershy: HAXABJA vf 3 ohg vf abg "jbefr guna PEVGVPNY" va gur
Antvbf frafr. Vg qbrf abg gnxr cneg va guvf nttertngvba urer, orpnhfr nal HAXABJA pnhfr fgbcf `Eha`
orsber gur qrpvfvba.

### Grfgvat n pbzznaq

`olgrf.Ohssre` naq `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` ner `vb.Jevgre`f, naq `fgevatf.ArjErnqre` vf na `vb.Ernqre`.
Gung vf nyy n grfg arrqf gb eha n pbzznaq va zrzbel. `vbgrfg.ReeErnqre` ergheaf na reebe ba gur
svefg `Ernq`; `vb.ZhygvErnqre` chgf fbzr qngn va sebag bs vg, fb gur reebe pbzrf va gur zvqqyr bs
gur vachg. Ab svyrf, ab cebprffrf, ab `bf.Rkvg`, naq gurersber ab synxvarff.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ernqvat fgqva orsber gur syntf ner purpxrq.** Jvgu `-u` be n glcb va n synt, gur pbzznaq
  jnvgf sbe vachg gung znl arire pbzr: n grezvany, be n `qs` gung unatf ba n qrnq ASF zbhag.
- **`bf.Rkvg` be `ybt.Sngny` vafvqr `Eha`.** Gur grfg ovanel rkvgf, naq n purpx rkvgf jvgu gur
  jebat pbqr.
- **Gur tybony synt frg.** Gur frpbaq grfg cnavpf jvgu "synt erqrsvarq", be n onq synt raqf gur
  grfg ovanel.
- **Ab `FrgBhgchg`.** Gur hfntr tbrf gb gur erny `bf.Fgqree`, naq gur grfg frrf na rzcgl fgqree.
- **`synt.ReeUryc` gerngrq yvxr nal reebe.** Gura `-u` jevgrf na HAXABJA yvar gb fgqbhg nf jryy.
- **N `j < p` purpx orsber `Cnefr`, be va n frggre.** Vg pbzcnerf ntnvafg qrsnhygf gung n yngre
  synt punatrf.
- **`GevzFhssvk` vafgrnq bs `PhgFhssvk`.** `95` jvgubhg `%` vf npprcgrq.
- **N yvar pbhagre gung fxvcf oynax yvarf be gur urnqre.**
- **Svygrevat `-k` orsber inyvqngvat.** N oebxra yvar bs n yrsg-bhg zbhag fyvcf guebhtu; gur ehyrf
  fnl rirel yvar zhfg or inyvq.
- **`yra(qvfxf) == 0` purpxrq orsber `Fpnaare.Ree`.** N ernq reebe trgf gur jebat ernfba.
- **N cnegvny fgnghf yvar.** Cevagvat gur yvar sbe gur svefg yvarf naq gura uvggvat n onq bar
  tvirf 2 yvarf, be 1 yvar jvgu gur jebat fgngr. Qrpvqr svefg, cevag bapr.
- **"Svkvat" gur tenzzne bs `nyy 1 svyr flfgrzf`.** Znpuvarf cnefr guvf yvar gbb; n sbezng gung
  punatrf jvgu gur pbhag vf uneqre gb zngpu.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Zbavgbevat Cyhtvaf `purpx_qvfx`**, gur cyhtva zbfg Antvbf naq Vpvatn frghcf eha, qbrf abg cnefr
  `qs`: vg pnyyf `fgngisf` sbe rnpu zbhag vgfrys. Vgf `-j` naq `-p` zrna **serr** fcnpr, abg hfrq
  fcnpr: `-j 20% -p 10%` jneaf jura yrff guna 20% vf serr. Ernq gur qverpgvba bs rirel guerfubyq
  orsber lbh pbcl n pbzznaq yvar orgjrra gbbyf.
- **Gur cyhtva thvqryvarf** qrsvar gur 4 pbqrf, fnl gung gur svefg yvar bs fgqbhg fubhyq or fubeg,
  naq fcrpvsl cresbeznapr qngn nf `'ynory'=inyhr[HBZ];[jnea];[pevg];[zva];[znk]`, dhbgrq jura gur
  ynory unf fcnprf. Vpvatn naq Anrzba fraq vg gb Tencuvgr, VasyhkQO be Cebzrgurhf, fb gur fnzr
  purpx tvirf lbh na nyreg naq n tencu.
- **Frafh Tb** ehaf purpx pbzznaqf jvgu gur fnzr 0 gb 3 rkvg pbqrf, fb Antvbf-fglyr cyhtvaf jbex
  gurer hapunatrq.
- **Cebzrgurhf** gheaf gur dhrfgvba nebhaq. `abqr_rkcbegre` rkcbegf
  `abqr_svyrflfgrz_ninvy_olgrf` naq `abqr_svyrflfgrz_fvmr_olgrf`, naq gur pbzzba nyreg qbrf abg hfr
  n svkrq crepragntr: `cerqvpg_yvarne(abqr_svyrflfgrz_ninvy_olgrf[6u], 4 * 3600) < 0` sverf jura
  gur geraq bs gur ynfg 6 ubhef svyyf gur qvfx jvguva 4 ubhef. Gur abqr-zvkva nyregf
  `AbqrSvyrflfgrzFcnprSvyyvatHc` naq `AbqrSvyrflfgrzNyzbfgBhgBsFcnpr` pbzovar obgu xvaqf bs ehyr.
- **Gur xhoryrg** rivpgf cbqf jura `abqrsf.ninvynoyr` qebcf orybj n guerfubyq (10% ol qrsnhyg):
  n qvfx purpx jubfr npgvba vf nhgbzngvp.
- **Pbzznaqf va Tb.** Gur `eha` shapgvba jvgu vawrpgrq nethzragf, fgernzf naq raivebazrag vf n
  pbzzba cnggrea; Zng Elre qrfpevorf vg sbe UGGC freivprf. Sbe raq-gb-raq grfgf bs n erny ovanel,
  `ebtcrccr/tb-vagreany/grfgfpevcg` ehaf furyy-yvxr fpevcgf ntnvafg vg, gur jnl gur Tb pbzznaq
  grfgf vgfrys.
- **Peba wbof naq furyy jenccref.** Fgneg rirel onfu fpevcg jvgu `frg -rhb cvcrsnvy`, naq grfg gur
  jenccre jvgu n purpx gung snvyf ba checbfr.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

Rirel yngre gbby va gur pbhefr hfrf guvf funcr: gur "Znxr vg n gbby" sbyybj-hcf bs 26-ybtszg naq
27-npprffybt, gur pbzznaq va 29-terc, naq gur peba wbo jvgu rkvg pbqrf va 43-pregpurpx. Va
40-urnygupurpx gur qrpvfvba vf ntnva frcnengrq sebz gur genafcbeg: n cher shapgvba qrpvqrf, naq n
guva UGGC unaqyre ercbegf.

